# POV-Ray: POV-Ray 3.7 documentation: Scene Description Language reference; requirements/languages/povray.md
name     povray pov inc-pov
keyword  camera light_source sphere box cylinder cone plane torus union difference intersection merge
keyword  object texture pigment finish normal color rgb rgbf location look_at angle translate rotate
keyword  scale declare local include if else end while for macro
builtin  x y z true false on off pi clock
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */  : nested
string   " "  : escapes
sigil    #    : meta
operators  +-*/=<>!&|?:<>.
calls
